    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d56ac1101b84dd70479c365",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……比赛中的感觉还没消失，\n我还清楚记得冲过终点板时的景色。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9374df6140568f8f05b5a7259e7b800ea1f547bd805322151c36e21bfc07d4a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ec81fe8220b6f52903861e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她对德比的强烈情感\n出乎我的意料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fceea490ec3fdecf51a1a11b63f2ed53a6652ae526daaca33c11f622a1ee96b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1957f9109c5889068e12b2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原本的她如同太阳般温暖柔和\n但此刻她的眼神截然不同，\n仿佛燃烧着熊熊火焰──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b9731c6148b930221e4c34fbbef4f549a61e7f9c18554bd5a66eaac6d39a265",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2b1eeb53e6e9073f15f270",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你需要的是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "31f8374b5159ed4f935801a79515757b8c39bf1cc86108e525049c8ff5c7ca75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247b8ebc4ac4e86c07cbdccc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc9369440a9b696bdc605b98c8ab781a251bb4149a0083c969293a17093fbba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
