        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f656e8e0cbdbba99b399ad05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我该做些什么才能参加德比？\n现在的我还缺少了什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fc139e4ab0bcfc1e6afb75bd5d56b1a5d10a87f9031240820261c580ae57a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07022a5ed97f271633bf81d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最首要的应该是经验和比赛的直觉反应力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "487cfe6d47dbe46a0f368cbef6c8a84a43df7f162999e6aecec4c23d171ac05c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd886b3c69e20cb19bfa7f62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若想快速培养这两项能力，\n挑战GⅠ竞赛也是一种好方法。在GⅠ可以对上\n以新马级王者为目标的赛马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48dbb3f6a4cf48af06543040ceeef36bcec17fb26c44a1c962829c0f78acb55d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc7209fafb66d75a474b108b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……但突然就以GⅠ为目标也未免太──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89836fa29939470fe3cafd6de15838701d6c361a19e223cdc069a1fcc5cfe99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a5795254409f05eb6f8863c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "像是朝日杯FS──\n“朝日杯未来锦标”\n等等……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4464e65c9a2591d4cbf960c54e82f2453bfa05fdd9f0a2f99db0e39a63b16164",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6659896778f14ba3ea8cc088",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我本身只是个新人训练员，\n而她也只是刚跑完出道战的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8231a7268aa750973e050ea646dd0d7cba0117a0096d209d94919885412435",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93eb67e20631c24bcb4b4bb8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在新马级GⅠ舞台上所要面对的，\n尽是些得天独厚的赛马娘。\n甚至很多都是从小就接触比赛的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "089b931c339d62e4251e153eaa4a11e5f4731ab5cc7f7946dd0de5cd1a5e6e10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3578f9a93738a79a6bf6c63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "考虑到她目前的能力，\n或许现在我们还不够资格\n挑战这个目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dd49c00b1801429f871acadda1c858e76b9dc74ef3a7349d0c26389b8d4132",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
